    "A report was saved after the app quit unexpectedly. You can send it to the Homebrew team on GitHub to help fix the problem, or discard it." : {"comment":"Application language preference menu or shared confirmation label. Applies after relaunch; never interrupts a running command.","localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"应用意外退出后已保存一份报告。你可以在 GitHub 上将报告发送给 Homebrew 团队，帮助修复问题，也可以丢弃报告。"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A report was saved after the app quit unexpectedly. You can send it to the Homebrew team on GitHub to help fix the problem, or discard it."}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"App 意外結束後已儲存一份報告。你可以透過 GitHub 將報告傳送給 Homebrew 團隊，協助修正問題，也可以將報告捨棄。"}}},"extractionState":"manual","generatesSymbol":false},
